      "text": "6 / relocateReserve 原子预留\nsource 本案 reserve -= reserveToMove\nreserveToMove ≤ amount 且 ≤本案预留\ndestination 本案 reserve += 全部 amount\n在 Quarantine 增加本案 HOLD",
      "originalText": "6 / relocateReserve 原子预留\nsource 本案 reserve -= reserveToMove\nreserveToMove ≤ amount 且 ≤本案预留\ndestination 本案 reserve += 全部 amount\n在 Quarantine 增加本案 HOLD",
