      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "12 / 受控释放 Quarantine\n所有源/目标 HOLD 均已批准解除\n重新签完整快照，preserve=false\n仅回登记 Treasury 并释放相应预留\n最终外付仍走 Treasury 提现协议",
      "originalText": "12 / 受控释放 Quarantine\n所有源/目标 HOLD 均已批准解除\n重新签完整快照，preserve=false\n仅回登记 Treasury 并释放相应预留\n最终外付仍走 Treasury 提现协议",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-07-disposition-release",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note0",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2258546,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note0-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note0-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 241.09999999999997,
      "y": 1543.75,
      "width": 757.8000000000001,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2742104,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "完整批准的边界\n合约核对 Council 签名和当前控制快照相等，不能解释链下证据或法律结论。\nCouncil 必须审阅快照包含的全部有效案件；一个 caseId 不等于批准其他限制。\n控制变化使旧签名失效；HOLD 可按批准例外迁移，但 SECURITY_PAUSED 永不在该入口绕过。\n源案件之外的 reserve 留在源池；转入 Quarantine 为全部 amount 加 reserve。",
      "originalText": "完整批准的边界\n合约核对 Council 签名和当前控制快照相等，不能解释链下证据或法律结论。\nCouncil 必须审阅快照包含的全部有效案件；一个 caseId 不等于批准其他限制。\n控制变化使旧签名失效；HOLD 可按批准例外迁移，但 SECURITY_PAUSED 永不在该入口绕过。\n源案件之外的 reserve 留在源池；转入 Quarantine 为全部 amount 加 reserve。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-07-disposition-note0",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note1",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1260,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2259517,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note1-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note1-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1389.35,
      "y": 1543.75,
      "width": 861.3000000000001,
      "height": 112.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2743075,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Clearing 的两个分支\n登记 lot：lotsHash = keccak256(abi.encode(lotIds, amounts))；总量必须等于 permit.amount。\nprepareDisposition 允许未成熟 lot，但原子退休释放量，后续不能重复 settle。\n未知直入款：lotsHash=0 且两数组为空，仅使用 balance-outstanding 超额部分。\n未知资产并不因为收到而变成白名单资产；当前实现不提供任意资产 rescue。",
      "originalText": "Clearing 的两个分支\n登记 lot：lotsHash = keccak256(abi.encode(lotIds, amounts))；总量必须等于 permit.amount。\nprepareDisposition 允许未成熟 lot，但原子退休释放量，后续不能重复 settle。\n未知直入款：lotsHash=0 且两数组为空，仅使用 balance-outstanding 超额部分。\n未知资产并不因为收到而变成白名单资产；当前实现不提供任意资产 rescue。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-07-disposition-note1",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-07-disposition-note2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1830,
      "width": 2320,
      "height": 220,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#e7f5ff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
